{"updatedAt":1792085412267,"payload":{"fragments":[{"id":"f000","text":"なんとなく、何もしたくない日。テスト前なのに、教科書を開いては閉じる。","createdAt":"2026-02-08T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.3,"arousal":0.25,"intensities":{"fatigue":0.6}},"people":[],"themes":[]},{"id":"f001","text":"バスケのチームメイトから連絡が来た。「復帰しないの?」って。返事はまだしていない。","createdAt":"2026-02-11T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.1,"arousal":0.4,"intensities":{"anxiety":0.5}},"people":["同期"],"themes":["バスケ"]},{"id":"f002","text":"ミナと電話。1時間半。何を話したかは覚えていないけど、少し楽になった。","createdAt":"2026-02-14T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.4,"arousal":0.3,"intensities":{"calm":0.6,"love":0.5}},"people":["ミナ"],"themes":["友達"]},{"id":"f003","text":"テストが終わった。解放感より、抜け殻みたいな感覚のほうが大きい。","createdAt":"2026-02-19T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0,"arousal":0.2,"intensities":{"fatigue":0.5}},"people":[],"themes":[]},{"id":"f064","text":"心の調子を崩して、全日制の高校をやめた。あの頃のことは、まだうまく言葉にできない。","createdAt":"2026-02-21T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.7,"arousal":0.35,"intensities":{"sadness":0.75,"fatigue":0.5}},"people":[],"themes":["学校","自分"]},{"id":"f004","text":"フィルムを現像に出した。冬の光は、思ったより優しかった。","createdAt":"2026-02-24T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.5,"arousal":0.4,"intensities":{"joy":0.5,"calm":0.4}},"people":[],"themes":["写真"]},{"id":"f005","text":"3月になったら、少し遠くへ行ってみたい。行き先は、まだ決めていない。","createdAt":"2026-02-27T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.4,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"anticipation":0.6}},"people":[],"themes":[]},{"id":"f006","text":"静岡に帰った。海が見えた瞬間、息ができる気がした。","createdAt":"2026-03-03T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.7,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"joy":0.6,"calm":0.5}},"people":[],"themes":["故郷"]},{"id":"f007","text":"母が「あんたは、いつも何か探してる顔してる」って笑った。図星すぎて、笑うしかなかった。","createdAt":"2026-03-06T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.4,"arousal":0.4,"intensities":{"love":0.6}},"people":["母"],"themes":["家族"]},{"id":"f008","text":"留学のことを調べ始めた。オーストラリア、1セメスター。考えるだけで、心臓がうるさい。","createdAt":"2026-03-10T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.6,"arousal":0.8,"intensities":{"anticipation":0.9}},"people":[],"themes":["留学"]},{"id":"f009","text":"留学のことを考えると、理由なんてわからなくていい気がする。行きたい、ただそれだけ。","createdAt":"2026-03-12T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.7,"arousal":0.75,"intensities":{"anticipation":0.9}},"people":[],"themes":["留学"]},{"id":"f010","text":"写真を撮りに、朝の海へ。誰もいない砂浜で、シャッターの音だけがした。","createdAt":"2026-03-15T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.6,"arousal":0.4,"intensities":{"calm":0.7,"joy":0.5}},"people":[],"themes":["写真"]},{"id":"f011","text":"財布の中を見て、現実に戻された。留学には、想像よりずっとお金がかかる。","createdAt":"2026-03-18T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.4,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"anxiety":0.6}},"people":[],"themes":["留学","お金"]},{"id":"f012","text":"ミナに留学の話をした。「行けばいいじゃん」って、あっさり言われて、泣きそうになった。","createdAt":"2026-03-22T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.6,"arousal":0.6,"intensities":{"joy":0.5,"love":0.6}},"people":["ミナ"],"themes":["留学","友達"]},{"id":"f013","text":"久しぶりに体育館に行った。ボールの音が、体の奥まで響いた。","createdAt":"2026-03-26T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.6,"arousal":0.6,"intensities":{"joy":0.6}},"people":[],"themes":["バスケ"]},{"id":"f065","text":"通信制に変えてから、世界について考える幅が広がった。教室は静かで、自由だった。","createdAt":"2026-03-28T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.35,"arousal":0.4,"intensities":{"calm":0.55,"anticipation":0.4}},"people":[],"themes":["学校","自分"]},{"id":"f014","text":"3月が終わる。今年は、何かが始まる気がする。","createdAt":"2026-03-30T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.5,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"anticipation":0.6}},"people":[],"themes":[]},{"id":"f015","text":"桜が、うるさいくらい咲いていた。","createdAt":"2026-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.5,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"joy":0.4,"calm":0.3}},"people":[],"themes":["街"]},{"id":"f016","text":"新年度が始まった。スクーリングの日。久しぶりに教室に入ると、少しだけ背筋が伸びる。","createdAt":"2026-04-03T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.4,"arousal":0.6,"intensities":{"anticipation":0.5}},"people":[],"themes":[]},{"id":"f017","text":"新歓で後輩のユイと話した。「先輩は、何がしたいんですか?」って聞かれて、言葉に詰まった。","createdAt":"2026-04-07T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.2,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"anxiety":0.5}},"people":["ユイ"],"themes":["自分"]},{"id":"f018","text":"留学の説明会に行った。夢が具体的になるほど、怖くなる。","createdAt":"2026-04-10T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.1,"arousal":0.6,"intensities":{"anticipation":0.5,"anxiety":0.6}},"people":[],"themes":["留学"]},{"id":"f019","text":"母に留学のことを話した。「応援はする。でも、よく考えなさい」って。その言い方が、一番効く。","createdAt":"2026-04-14T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.1,"arousal":0.4,"intensities":{"anxiety":0.5}},"people":["母"],"themes":["留学","家族"]},{"id":"f020","text":"みんなが期待してくれるから、期待に応える自分でいたい。でも、それは本当は誰の期待でもない気がする。","createdAt":"2026-04-18T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.2,"arousal":0.45,"intensities":{"anticipation":0.4,"anxiety":0.3}},"people":[],"themes":["自分"]},{"id":"f066","text":"最近、物事を哲学的に考えるようになった。すぐに答えを出さず、問いを持ったまま歩けるようになった。","createdAt":"2026-04-20T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.5,"arousal":0.3,"intensities":{"calm":0.65,"anticipation":0.3}},"people":[],"themes":["哲学","自分"]},{"id":"f021","text":"悠斗と学食で2時間話した。彼は就活の話をしながら、目が笑っていた。","createdAt":"2026-04-22T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.4,"arousal":0.4,"intensities":{"joy":0.4}},"people":["悠斗"],"themes":["友達","就活"]},{"id":"f022","text":"バイトを増やした。留学のため。疲れるけど、口座の数字が増えるのは、正直うれしい。","createdAt":"2026-04-27T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.3,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"joy":0.4,"fatigue":0.4}},"people":[],"themes":["お金","留学"]},{"id":"f023","text":"連休はバイトで埋まった。SNSで友達の旅行写真を見て、少しだけ、しんどい。","createdAt":"2026-05-02T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.4,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"sadness":0.5}},"people":[],"themes":["友達"]},{"id":"f024","text":"お金のことを考えると、留学は諦めたほうがいい。これが現実だ、そういうことにしようとした。","createdAt":"2026-05-06T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.6,"arousal":0.4,"intensities":{"sadness":0.7}},"people":[],"themes":["留学","お金"]},{"id":"f025","text":"諦めるって決めた瞬間は、痛いのに、少しだけ楽だった。ずるい。","createdAt":"2026-05-09T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.5,"arousal":0.4,"intensities":{"sadness":0.6}},"people":[],"themes":["留学"]},{"id":"f026","text":"バスケのチームメイトの試合を見に行った。コートの上の自分は、楽しそうだった。","createdAt":"2026-05-14T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.2,"arousal":0.4,"intensities":{"sadness":0.5}},"people":["同期"],"themes":["バスケ"]},{"id":"f027","text":"ユイが「留学、楽しみですね」って言ってきた。まだ何も決めてないのに。善意が、重い。","createdAt":"2026-05-18T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.3,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"anxiety":0.6}},"people":["ユイ"],"themes":["留学"]},{"id":"f028","text":"ミナと電話。「諦めるの、早くない?」って。黙ってしまった。","createdAt":"2026-05-23T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.5,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"sadness":0.5}},"people":["ミナ"],"themes":["留学"]},{"id":"f029","text":"夜、写真の整理をした。2月の頃の自分が、まだ何かを信じている顔をしている。","createdAt":"2026-05-28T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.1,"arousal":0.4,"intensities":{"calm":0.4,"sadness":0.3}},"people":[],"themes":["写真"]},{"id":"f067","text":"いつも、どこか寂しい。誰かといても、一人でも、同じように。","createdAt":"2026-05-30T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.6,"arousal":0.3,"intensities":{"sadness":0.7}},"people":[],"themes":["寂しさ","自分"]},{"id":"f030","text":"駅前の古い喫茶店が、閉店していた。名前は知らないけど、いつも窓際にいた。","createdAt":"2026-05-31T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.3,"arousal":0.3,"intensities":{"sadness":0.5}},"people":[],"themes":["社会"]},{"id":"f031","text":"久しぶりにカメラを持って歩いた。雨上がりの街は、全部が少しだけ光っていた。","createdAt":"2026-06-02T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.6,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"joy":0.6,"calm":0.4}},"people":[],"themes":["写真"]},{"id":"f032","text":"悠斗と写真展に行った。「こんな写真、撮りたい」って言ったら、「撮ればいいじゃん」って返された。","createdAt":"2026-06-06T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.5,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"joy":0.5,"anticipation":0.5}},"people":["悠斗"],"themes":["写真"]},{"id":"f068","text":"本を読む速度が落ちた。一頁ずつ、噛みしめるようになった。","createdAt":"2026-06-08T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.4,"arousal":0.25,"intensities":{"calm":0.6}},"people":[],"themes":["哲学"]},{"id":"f033","text":"後輩たちとご飯。笑いすぎて、腹が痛い。こういう夜が、実は一番こわい。失いたくないから。","createdAt":"2026-06-11T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.6,"arousal":0.6,"intensities":{"joy":0.6,"anxiety":0.3}},"people":["ユイ"],"themes":["友達"]},{"id":"f034","text":"留学のことも、就活のことも、考えるのをやめた。考えると、動けなくなるから。","createdAt":"2026-06-16T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0,"arousal":0.35,"intensities":{"anxiety":0.4}},"people":[],"themes":["留学","就活"]},{"id":"f035","text":"大学のオープンキャンパスに行った。話を聞きながら、心がどこか、遠い国にあった。","createdAt":"2026-06-21T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.2,"arousal":0.45,"intensities":{"sadness":0.4}},"people":[],"themes":["就活","留学"]},{"id":"f036","text":"「いつか」って言葉が口癖になっている。いつかは、来ない気がする。","createdAt":"2026-06-27T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.4,"arousal":0.4,"intensities":{"sadness":0.5}},"people":[],"themes":["自分"]},{"id":"f037","text":"期末が近い。頭が重い。やることが多いのに、時間が溶けていく。","createdAt":"2026-07-02T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.4,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"fatigue":0.7,"anxiety":0.4}},"people":[],"themes":[]},{"id":"f069","text":"彼女に会えない時間が、いちばん長い。遠いということは、こういうことか。","createdAt":"2026-07-06T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.2,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"love":0.7,"sadness":0.6}},"people":[],"themes":["彼女","寂しさ"]},{"id":"f038","text":"写真を見た先生に「あなたの写真は、人の気配がする」って言われた。うれしかった。","createdAt":"2026-07-08T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.6,"arousal":0.4,"intensities":{"joy":0.5}},"people":["先生"],"themes":["写真"]},{"id":"f039","text":"街の再開発のニュースを見た。学生のころから通った商店が、なくなるらしい。","createdAt":"2026-07-13T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.4,"arousal":0.4,"intensities":{"sadness":0.5}},"people":[],"themes":["社会"]},{"id":"f040","text":"ミナと久しぶりに会った。彼女も疲れている顔をしていた。私だけじゃない、と思ったら、少し楽になった。","createdAt":"2026-07-17T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.2,"arousal":0.4,"intensities":{"calm":0.4}},"people":["ミナ"],"themes":["友達"]},{"id":"f041","text":"誰の期待にも応えられない自分が嫌だ。でも、自分の感覚も信じられない。どっちも本音で、つらい。","createdAt":"2026-07-22T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.6,"arousal":0.55,"intensities":{"sadness":0.6,"anxiety":0.5}},"people":[],"themes":["自分"]},{"id":"f042","text":"夜中に、ふと3月の海を思い出した。あの時の私は、なんであんなに強気だったんだろう。","createdAt":"2026-07-29T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0,"arousal":0.35,"intensities":{"calm":0.3}},"people":[],"themes":["写真","故郷"]},{"id":"f043","text":"帰省した。弟が、私より背が高くなっていた。家族の時間は、私が思うより速く流れている。","createdAt":"2026-08-03T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.2,"arousal":0.4,"intensities":{"love":0.5}},"people":["弟"],"themes":["家族"]},{"id":"f044","text":"父さんと川まで歩いた。ほとんど話さなかった。でも、帰り道に「やりたいことがあるなら、やれ」って言われた。","createdAt":"2026-08-07T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.7,"arousal":0.6,"intensities":{"joy":0.6,"love":0.6}},"people":["父"],"themes":["家族","留学"]},{"id":"f045","text":"父さんはいつも黙っているから、何を考えているか知らなかった。あの一言で、私が勝手に作っていた壁だったんだと知った。","createdAt":"2026-08-08T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.8,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"joy":0.6,"love":0.7}},"people":["父"],"themes":["家族","留学"]},{"id":"f046","text":"海に写真を撮りに行った。夏の光は、強くて、正直だ。","createdAt":"2026-08-12T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.6,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"joy":0.5}},"people":[],"themes":["写真"]},{"id":"f047","text":"帰りの電車で、留学のことをまた考えた。こんどは、怖さより、わくわくが多かった。","createdAt":"2026-08-16T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.6,"arousal":0.7,"intensities":{"anticipation":0.8}},"people":[],"themes":["留学"]},{"id":"f048","text":"奨学金の制度を調べた。知らなかっただけで、扉は思ったより多かった。","createdAt":"2026-08-20T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.5,"arousal":0.6,"intensities":{"joy":0.5,"anticipation":0.6}},"people":[],"themes":["留学","お金"]},{"id":"f049","text":"バイト先の店長に、留学の話をした。「海外で働ける人は、強いよ」って。初めて、その言葉が体に入った。","createdAt":"2026-08-24T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.6,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"joy":0.5}},"people":["店長"],"themes":["留学"]},{"id":"f050","text":"ミナに、8月のことを全部話した。「戻ってきたね」って言われた。戻ってきたのは、私のほうだった。","createdAt":"2026-08-29T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.7,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"joy":0.6,"love":0.5}},"people":["ミナ"],"themes":["友達"]},{"id":"f051","text":"留学エージェントの面談を、予約した。予約ボタンを押す手が、少し震えた。","createdAt":"2026-09-02T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.6,"arousal":0.7,"intensities":{"anticipation":0.8,"anxiety":0.3}},"people":[],"themes":["留学"]},{"id":"f052","text":"エージェントの話を聞きながら、3月の「心臓がうるさい」って感覚を思い出した。あれが、たぶん答えだ。","createdAt":"2026-09-05T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.7,"arousal":0.7,"intensities":{"anticipation":0.8,"joy":0.6}},"people":[],"themes":["留学"]},{"id":"f053","text":"見積もりを見て、覚悟した。金額は現実的だ。問題は、私の覚悟のほうだった。","createdAt":"2026-09-09T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.3,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"calm":0.5,"anticipation":0.5}},"people":[],"themes":["留学","お金"]},{"id":"f070","text":"うれしいのに、悲しい。幸せなのに、怖い。矛盾のまま生きている。","createdAt":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.1,"arousal":0.6,"intensities":{"joy":0.5,"sadness":0.6}},"people":[],"themes":["自分","矛盾"]},{"id":"f054","text":"母に、本気でやることを伝えた。返事は「アジア料理、教えなきゃね」だった。母らしかった。","createdAt":"2026-09-13T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.7,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"love":0.7,"joy":0.5}},"people":["母"],"themes":["家族","留学"]},{"id":"f055","text":"バスケのチームメイトたちが、応援メッセージをくれた。送ったのは、私を差し置いてミナだった。余計なことを、ありがとう。","createdAt":"2026-09-17T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.8,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"joy":0.6,"love":0.6}},"people":["ミナ","同期"],"themes":["友達","バスケ"]},{"id":"f056","text":"後輩のユイに「かっこいいっす」って言われた。面と向かって言われると、照れる。","createdAt":"2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.7,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"joy":0.6}},"people":["ユイ"],"themes":["友達"]},{"id":"f057","text":"提出書類の山。1つ終わるごとに、世界が少しずつ前に進んでいる。","createdAt":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.4,"arousal":0.6,"intensities":{"anticipation":0.4,"fatigue":0.4}},"people":[],"themes":["留学"]},{"id":"f058","text":"秋になった。あと2週間で、出すものすべてを出す。","createdAt":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.5,"arousal":0.6,"intensities":{"anticipation":0.6}},"people":[],"themes":["留学"]},{"id":"f059","text":"夜、ふと止まった。この選択は、本当に私のものか、確かめたくなる。","createdAt":"2026-10-04T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":-0.2,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"anxiety":0.5}},"people":[],"themes":["自分","留学"]},{"id":"f060","text":"ミナが「迷ったら、最初に心臓が鳴ったほうにしなよ」って。3月の私と、同じことを言っている。","createdAt":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.6,"arousal":0.4,"intensities":{"love":0.6,"joy":0.4}},"people":["ミナ"],"themes":["友達"]},{"id":"f061","text":"資料を全部テーブルに広げて、写真を一枚だけ、そこに置いた。写真も、もう答えを知っている気がした。","createdAt":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.6,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"anticipation":0.6,"calm":0.4}},"people":[],"themes":["写真","留学"]},{"id":"f071","text":"人生は、短いようで長く、長いようで短い。それでも今日は、今日のぶんだけ。","createdAt":"2026-10-11T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.4,"arousal":0.3,"intensities":{"calm":0.55,"love":0.35}},"people":[],"themes":["自分","哲学"]},{"id":"f062","text":"申込書の最後の欄。ペンを持つ手は、3月より落ち着いている。","createdAt":"2026-10-12T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.6,"arousal":0.5,"intensities":{"anticipation":0.7,"calm":0.5}},"people":[],"themes":["留学"]},{"id":"f063","text":"明日、出す。","createdAt":"2026-10-14T00:00:00.000Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.7,"arousal":0.6,"intensities":{"anticipation":0.8,"joy":0.5}},"people":[],"themes":["留学"]},{"id":"u-mv9tctx1-440","text":"今日は、昔の友達に偶然会って、少し嬉しかった。","createdAt":"2026-10-15T17:29:25.621Z","source":"user","emotion":{"valence":0.8,"arousal":0.7,"intensities":{"joy":0.45}},"people":[],"themes":["友達"]}],"thoughts":[{"id":"st-15uybgl-1792085281","createdAt":"2026-10-15T17:28:01.776Z","kind":"recall","text":"9月5日の「あれが、たぶん答えだ」。それは3月10日の「心臓がうるさい」を、自分の言葉で引き直している。","from":["f063","f052","f008"],"path":["f063","f052","f008"],"steps":[{"label":"起点","detail":"10月14日の断片を活性化（期待）"},{"label":"拡散","detail":"9月5日へ — 同じ期待が重なる"},{"label":"跳躍","detail":"3月10日へ — 自分の言葉を引用（「心臓がうるさい」）"}],"engine":"local","score":3.3899696991924864,"fingerprint":"f008|f052|f063","status":"new","trace":{"cycle":0,"preferredMode":"resonance","seeds":[{"id":"f063","date":"10月14日","reason":"2日前の断片","activation":0.758},{"id":"f062","date":"10月12日","reason":"4日前の断片","activation":0.706},{"id":"f052","date":"9月5日","reason":"記憶の核（活性が高い）","activation":0.763}],"walks":[{"mode":"resonance","score":3.39,"path":["f063","f052","f008"],"chosen":true},{"mode":"resonance","score":2.458,"path":["f063","f008","f052"],"chosen":false},{"mode":"resonance","score":2.422,"path":["f062","f008","f052"],"chosen":false},{"mode":"resonance","score":2.404,"path":["f052","f008","f058"],"chosen":false},{"mode":"resonance","score":2.387,"path":["f052","f008","f047"],"chosen":false},{"mode":"resonance","score":2.229,"path":["f052","f008"],"chosen":false},{"mode":"resonance","score":1.613,"path":["f062","f008"],"chosen":false},{"mode":"resonance","score":1.511,"path":["f052","f063"],"chosen":false},{"mode":"contrast","score":2.214,"path":["f063","f024"],"chosen":false},{"mode":"contrast","score":2.119,"path":["f062","f024"],"chosen":false},{"mode":"contrast","score":2.104,"path":["f063","f011"],"chosen":false},{"mode":"contrast","score":2.097,"path":["f063","f025"],"chosen":false}],"drafts":[{"kind":"recall","mode":"resonance